{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestQuit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TurnResultV","text":"TurnResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TurnResult"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The final turn’s output and status (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isFinished == true"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Once the game has already ended — the death prompt, or a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"won"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lost"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"quit"},{"text":" status left by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"end(won:)"},{"text":" or an earlier quit — the epilogue has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already printed, on the turn that ended it, so this takes the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exit the typed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"quit"},{"text":" answer takes at the death prompt: stop reading,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"say nothing more.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Quits at the front end’s request — a Ctrl-C, not a typed command.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Abandons any open engine prompt or clarification and ends the game","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the same path the ","type":"text"},{"code":"quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" verb takes, so the score epilogue still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints. Keyed to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Intent.quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so it’s immune to a game redefining the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" verb word and quits even while a save\/restore filename prompt is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pending — which ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" would otherwise consume the line as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"filename answer.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameWorld\/requestQuit()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameworld\/requestquit()"]}],"metadata":{"title":"requestQuit()","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Gnusto9GameWorldC11requestQuitAA10TurnResultVyF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requestQuit","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TurnResultV","text":"TurnResult","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/write(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/readLine(prompt:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/showStatus(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/wantsCompletions","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/updateCompletions(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/finish(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Input","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusLine","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameStatus","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates\/Context-swift.enum","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TerminalIOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ConsoleIOHandler","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScriptedIOHandler"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameWorld"]]},"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"IOHandler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"IOHandler"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler","title":"IOHandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where the game’s text goes and player input comes from. Synchronous by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"design: a blocking console read is fine for a CLI; an async variant can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be added later without breaking this protocol’s clients."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/CompletionCandidates/Context-swift.enum":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Context","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Context","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/completioncandidates\/context-swift.enum","title":"CompletionCandidates.Context","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates\/Context-swift.enum","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What the next input line will be read as, which decides the pool: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normal command, or a save\/restore filename."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TerminalIOHandler":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TerminalIOHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TerminalIOHandler","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/terminaliohandler","kind":"symbol","title":"TerminalIOHandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A full-screen, Infocom-style terminal front end: a fixed status bar (room,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"score, turns) above a story window that re-wraps its entire transcript to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the window width — so resizing the terminal reflows the text — with its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line editor (arrow keys, history) and PageUp\/PageDown scrollback."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TerminalIOHandler"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/readLine(prompt:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"readLine","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"prompt","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5InputO","text":"Input","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"required":true,"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/readline(prompt:)","title":"readLine(prompt:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/readLine(prompt:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Prompts for and returns one unit of input; "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means end of input."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An engine for writing interactive fiction in Swift."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto","title":"Gnusto","role":"collection"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ConsoleIOHandler":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsoleIOHandler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ConsoleIOHandler"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/consoleiohandler","title":"ConsoleIOHandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Plain terminal IO."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ConsoleIOHandler"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TurnResult":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TurnResult"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TurnResult"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/turnresult","title":"TurnResult","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The outcome of a single turn: text to show, whether the game ended, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"status line to display."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TurnResult"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Input":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Input","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Input","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/input","title":"Input","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Input","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One unit of player input from an "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":": a line for the engine to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run, or a front-end quit request (e.g. Ctrl-C) that ends the game "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"without"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"being parsed as a command — so it can’t be swallowed by an open save\/restore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prompt or clash with a game that has redefined the "},{"code":"quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" verb. The REPL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maps "},{"code":".quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"code":"GameWorld.requestQuit()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", which is keyed to "},{"code":"Intent.quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than the editable verb word."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameWorld/requestQuit()":{"title":"requestQuit()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Quits at the front end’s request — a Ctrl-C, not a typed command."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Abandons any open engine prompt or clarification and ends the game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through the same path the "},{"code":"quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" verb takes, so the score epilogue still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints. Keyed to "},{"code":"Intent.quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so it’s immune to a game redefining the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"quit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" verb word and quits even while a save\/restore filename prompt is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pending — which "},{"code":"perform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" would otherwise consume the line as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"filename answer."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameWorld\/requestQuit()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameworld\/requestquit()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestQuit"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TurnResultV","text":"TurnResult"}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/StatusLine":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StatusLine","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StatusLine","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/statusline","title":"StatusLine","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/StatusLine","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The status line a handler can display: location, score, and turn count."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/write(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"write","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","title":"write(_:)","required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/write(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Writes pre-formatted text (no trailing-newline policy is implied).","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/write(_:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/showStatus(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"showStatus","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10StatusLineV","text":"StatusLine","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"required":true,"type":"topic","defaultImplementations":1,"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/showstatus(_:)","title":"showStatus(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/showStatus(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optionally displays a status line (location, score, turns)."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/updateCompletions(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"updateCompletions","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto20CompletionCandidatesV","text":"CompletionCandidates","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"updateCompletions(_:)","defaultImplementations":1,"required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/updatecompletions(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Receives the words Tab-completion may offer for the next input line.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A handler with a line editor uses them; the plain console ignores them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Called only when "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/wantsCompletions","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/updateCompletions(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/finish(_:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"finish","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"finish(_:)","defaultImplementations":1,"required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/finish(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Called once when the game reaches an ending (won, lost, or quit),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after the final output has been written. A full-screen handler holds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its last frame for the player and leaves the ending visible on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"primary screen; the default does nothing."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/finish(_:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/CompletionCandidates":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CompletionCandidates","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"CompletionCandidates","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/completioncandidates","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CompletionCandidates","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A snapshot of what Tab-completion can offer for the upcoming input line: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"game’s verbs, the nouns and adjectives currently in scope, the movement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directions, and the save slot names on disk. The engine assembles it after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each turn and pushes it to the IO handler, because the synchronous line","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"editor can’t reach back into the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameWorld"},{"text":" actor mid-read.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/CompletionCandidates","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/IOHandler/wantsCompletions":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"wantsCompletions","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"wantsCompletions","defaultImplementations":1,"required":true,"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/iohandler\/wantscompletions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this handler will use the words "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/updateCompletions(_:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivers. Computing them costs a scope walk and a read of the save"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"directory after every turn, so the REPL asks first and a handler with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no line editor — the console, a script, a test — never pays for a set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it would throw away. Defaults to "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TerminalIOHandler","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" says"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IOHandler\/wantsCompletions","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/ScriptedIOHandler":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScriptedIOHandler"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ScriptedIOHandler"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/scriptediohandler","title":"ScriptedIOHandler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Feeds a fixed list of commands and records everything into a transcript —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for tests and automated playthroughs. Ships in the library because game"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authors want transcript tests too."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/ScriptedIOHandler"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameWorld":{"fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameWorld","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GameWorld","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gameworld","title":"GameWorld","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameWorld","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The game world: owns all state, serializes all mutation, and runs the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn pipeline. The single "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"type":"text","text":" in a game sits between the REPL and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this actor."}]},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/GameStatus":{"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"GameStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/gamestatus","title":"GameStatus","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameStatus","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the game is in progress or how it ended."}]}}}